== 9 error-handling mode (PROPAGATE is the gateway default; NULL via per-request onError)
      09-nullable-null: {"errors":[{"message":"The current user is not authorized to access this resource.","path":["device","notes"],"extensions":{"code":"AUTH_NOT_AUTHORIZED"}}],"data":{"device":{"id":"dev-00001","hostname":"alpha","notes":null}}}
      09-nonnull-propagate: {"errors":[{"message":"The current user is not authorized to access this resource.","path":["device","noteCount"],"extensions":{"code":"AUTH_NOT_AUTHORIZED"}}],"data":{"device":null}}
      09-nonnull-null: {"errors":[{"message":"The current user is not authorized to access this resource.","path":["device","noteCount"],"extensions":{"code":"AUTH_NOT_AUTHORIZED"}}],"data":{"device":{"id":"dev-00001","hostname":"alpha","noteCount":null}}}
      09-stop-nullable-null: {"errors":[{"message":"Unexpected Execution Error","path":["device","notes"]}],"data":{"device":{"id":"dev-00001","hostname":"alpha","notes":null}}}
      09-stop-nonnull-propagate: {"errors":[{"message":"Unexpected Execution Error","path":["device","noteCount"]}],"data":{"device":null}}
PASS  9 nullable field + onError NULL: same shape as PROPAGATE (denied)
PASS  9 NON-null field + PROPAGATE: error nulls the whole device (why extension fields must stay nullable)
PASS  9 outage on NON-null field + PROPAGATE: whole device null too
